<title>MEXICO: Official results in Mexican congress vote 1730 GMT.</title>
<headline>Official results in Mexican congress vote 1730 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are preliminary official results from Mexico's Federal Electoral Institute (IFE) for Sunday's election of the lower house of Congress, the Chamber of Deputies.</p>
<p>NUMBER OF POLLING BOOTHS REPORTING: 84.62 percent of total.</p>
<p>   Institutional Revolutionary Party (PRI)	 38.64 percent</p>
<p>   National Action Party (PAN)			 27.10 percent</p>
<p>   Party of the Democratic Revolution (PRD)	25.65 percent</p>
<p>   Green Ecologist Party of Mexico (PVEM)	   3.90 percent</p>
<p>   Workers Party (PT)				     2.53 percent</p>
<p>   Other parties					    2.18 percent</p>
</text>
